-- 3..12, queried from world.item_template (grouped by itemset, names from
-- ItemSet.dbc + season prefix, WotLK replica items 42625-42722 excluded).
-- Arena seasons keep ONE set per class (the spec variants share the same
-- skin); vanilla PvP has one set per class PER FACTION (Field Marshal's /
-- Warlord's have distinct visuals, TBC faction swaps included so both
-- factions cover all 9 classes).
-- Attached below to PrestigeData.Milestones: the primary reward (mount or
-- weapon) stays FIRST, then one transmogSet entry per class set; the pager
-- browses them and the server grants each set's appearances straight into
-- the wardrobe collection (same '|' groups in world.prestige_milestone, no
-- mail involved). Regenerate rather than hand-edit.
-- ============================================================================

